# Parcego Billing & Payments – UI Implementation Rule

## Objective

Build the Billing & Payments page (`/billing`) for the Ashraf Courier Business Platform, providing merchants with a comprehensive, accessible, and modern interface for managing payment history, invoices, payment methods, billing preferences, tax documents, and financial reporting.  
**No backend logic or API integration—focus is on layout, navigation, and user experience.**

---

## 1. Technology & Design System

- **Framework:** Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS only
- **UI Components:** shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com/)
- **State Management:** Zustand (for client-side state, if needed)
- **Transitions:** Use premium, subtle transitions as per premium-transitions-and-effects.mdc
- **Accessibility:** All UI must be accessible (ARIA, keyboard navigation, color contrast)

---

## 2. Scope & Requirements

### Billing & Payments Features (All UI, No Backend)
- **Payment History:** Table/list of past payments, status, amount, date, invoice link, downloadable PDF.
- **Invoice Management:** View, download, and filter invoices; status badges (Paid, Due, Overdue); invoice details modal.
- **Payment Methods:** List, add, edit, and remove payment methods (credit card, ACH, etc.); set default method.
- **Billing Preferences:** Editable billing address, contact info, notification preferences.
- **Tax Documents:** List and download tax forms (mock data, e.g., 1099, VAT invoices).
- **Financial Reporting:** Downloadable/exportable reports (CSV, PDF); summary cards for totals, outstanding, etc.
- **Notifications:** Banner for overdue invoices, expiring payment methods, or billing issues.
- **Responsive Design:** Fully responsive for mobile, tablet, and desktop.

---

## 3. Page Structure & Layout

### Header Section
- **Page Title:** "Billing & Payments" with icon (`parcego-billing-header-title`)
- **Summary Cards:** Outstanding balance, last payment, next invoice, total paid YTD (`parcego-billing-summary-card-{type}`)
- **Action Buttons:** Add Payment Method, Download Report (`parcego-billing-add-method-btn`, `parcego-billing-download-report-btn`)

### Main Content Area
- **Tabs/Sections:** Payment History, Invoices, Payment Methods, Tax Documents, Preferences (`parcego-billing-tabs`)
- **Table/List:** For payment history and invoices, with sorting, filtering, and pagination (`parcego-billing-table-{section}`)
- **Details Modal:** For invoice/payment details, with download/print options (`parcego-billing-modal-{purpose}`)
- **Forms:** For adding/editing payment methods and billing preferences (`parcego-billing-form-{purpose}`)

### Sidebar (Optional)
- **Quick Links:** Download all invoices, view tax documents, update billing info
- **Help/Support:** Link to billing FAQ or support

---

## 4. Data Structure & Mock Data

### Payment Object
```typescript
export type PaymentStatus = 'paid' | 'pending' | 'failed' | 'refunded';
export interface Payment {
  id: string;
  date: string; // ISO string
  amount: number;
  currency: string;
  status: PaymentStatus;
  method: string; // e.g., 'Visa •••• 1234'
  invoiceId: string;
  downloadUrl: string;
}
```

### Invoice Object
```typescript
export type InvoiceStatus = 'paid' | 'due' | 'overdue';
export interface Invoice {
  id: string;
  date: string; // ISO string
  dueDate: string; // ISO string
  amount: number;
  currency: string;
  status: InvoiceStatus;
  downloadUrl: string;
  lineItems: Array<{ description: string; amount: number; }>;
}
```

### Payment Method Object
```typescript
export type PaymentMethodType = 'card' | 'ach' | 'paypal';
export interface PaymentMethod {
  id: string;
  type: PaymentMethodType;
  label: string; // e.g., 'Visa •••• 1234'
  isDefault: boolean;
  expiry?: string; // MM/YY for cards
}
```

### Tax Document Object
```typescript
export interface TaxDocument {
  id: string;
  year: number;
  type: string; // e.g., '1099', 'VAT'
  downloadUrl: string;
  issuedDate: string; // ISO string
}
```

---

## 5. State Management

- **Local State:** Current tab/section, selected items, filters, modals, form data
- **Mock Data:** Use static arrays for all lists and details
- **No API calls or backend logic**

---

## 6. User Interactions & Behaviors

- **Tab Navigation:** Switch between Payment History, Invoices, Payment Methods, Tax Documents, Preferences
- **Table Sorting/Filtering:** By date, status, amount, etc.
- **Download/Print:** Invoices, tax documents, reports
- **Add/Edit/Delete:** Payment methods, billing info
- **Set Default:** Payment method
- **Responsive:** All features accessible on mobile and desktop
- **Accessibility:** ARIA labels, keyboard navigation, screen reader support

---

## 7. UI Components & IDs

- **Main Container:** `parcego-billing-container`
- **Header:** `parcego-billing-header-title`
- **Summary Cards:** `parcego-billing-summary-card-{type}`
- **Tabs:** `parcego-billing-tabs`
- **Table/List:** `parcego-billing-table-{section}`
- **Row Items:** `parcego-billing-row-{id}`
- **Action Buttons:** `parcego-billing-add-method-btn`, `parcego-billing-download-report-btn`
- **Modals:** `parcego-billing-modal-{purpose}`
- **Forms:** `parcego-billing-form-{purpose}`
- **Empty States:** `parcego-billing-empty-state-{section}`
- **Loading State:** `parcego-billing-loading-skeleton`

---

## 8. Accessibility Requirements

- **ARIA Labels:** All interactive elements
- **Keyboard Navigation:** Logical tab order, focus states
- **Screen Reader Support:** Announce status changes, errors, and confirmations
- **Color Contrast:** WCAG AA compliance

---

## 9. Performance & UX

- **Loading States:** Skeletons for tables and cards
- **Transitions:** Smooth tab/content transitions, subtle hover/active effects
- **Pagination/Virtualization:** For large payment/invoice lists
- **Error Handling:** Friendly error and empty states

---

